# The Deploy to Cloudflare button shows each key in this file as a required
# field. fullsend needs no secret at deploy time, so every key here is a
# comment. Copy this file to .dev.vars for local work.
#
# Optional overrides. Without them, fullsend makes its own values and keeps
# them in D1.
# SETUP_TOKEN=    opens the first setup in place of the generated setup code
# SESSION_SECRET= signs the click tracking links and the dashboard sessions
#
# The first setup writes these two as Worker secrets from the token that the
# owner pastes. A local dev server cannot do that, so set them here.
# CF_API_TOKEN=
# CF_ACCOUNT_ID=
#
# For a local dashboard without a login, add AUTH_MODE=dev. The first setup
# chooses Access or a password, not this file.
